 "html": "\n<p class=\"ds-note\">What the product says and does — generated from its source into <a href=\"../kb/index.html\"><code>kb/</code></a>. Every component page links to the copy it renders and the notes written about it; every compiled page links to its route's page here.</p>\n<div class=\"ds-kb\">\n\n<a href=\"../kb/product/screens.html\"><b>Screen map</b><span>Every route, what it shows and who can reach it</span></a>\n<a href=\"../kb/product/flags.html\"><b>KSA tenant flags</b><span>The tenant flags that switch features on and off for KSA</span></a>\n<a href=\"../kb/product/copy.html\"><b>Product copy</b><span>Every string, by area — 101 areas</span></a>\n<a href=\"../kb/index.html\"><b>Profolio KSA</b><span>The whole knowledge base</span></a>\n</div>\n<h3>Routes</h3>\n<ul class=\"ds-uses\"><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/dashboard.html\">Overview</a> <small>dashboard</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/listings.html\">Listings</a> <small>listings</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/credits-usage.html\">Credits Usage</a> <small>credits-usage</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/ad-license.html\">Ad License</a> <small>ad-license</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/lms-leads.html\">Lms</a> <small>lms-leads</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/reports-summary.html\">Reports</a> <small>reports-summary</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/reports-listing-report.html\">Reports</a> <small>reports-listing-report</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/reports-leads-reports.html\">Reports</a> <small>reports-leads-reports</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/user-profile.html\">User Profile</a> <small>user-settings-user-profile</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/agency-profile.html\">Agency Profile</a> <small>user-settings-agency-profile</small></li><li><a href=\"../kb/pages/change-password.html\">Change Password</a> <small>user-settings-change-password</small></li></ul>\n"
